
Duty deletion-evidence-duty
    Holder compute-provider
    Claimant provider
    Related to resource, job

Fact deletion-evidence-submitted
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact deletion-evidence-accepted
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * job

Fact deletion-deadline-expired
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact deletion-deadline-breached
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Act close-job
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
    Terminates admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act submit-evidence
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-submitted(
        compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)

Act accept-evidence
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates deletion-evidence-accepted(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, job)
    Terminates deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-evidence-submitted(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act assess-deadline
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, job
    Creates deletion-deadline-breached(
        compute-provider, resource, job)
    Holds when deletion-evidence-duty(
        compute-provider, provider, resource, job)
        && deletion-deadline-expired(
            compute-provider, resource, job)
        && !deletion-evidence-accepted(
            provider, compute-provider, resource, job)
        && controls(provider, resource)
